  "title": {
   "en": "Yuurei-san to Furyou A"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "幽霊さんと不良A"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Azuse Nagi transfers to the infamous Fukura High School, known for its bad reputation.\nThere, in an unused student guidance room, he meets a ghostly boy who introduces himself as \"Yuurei-san.\"\nNo matter how much he ignores him, the persistent ghost keeps asking, \"Let's play together\".\nReluctantly, Azuse agrees to a game: if he wins, the ghost will leave, but if he loses, he'll have to follow one of his requests.\nWhat starts as a trivial bet begins to significantly change Azuse's school life.\nThis is the beginning of a school fantasy that depicts the thrilling friendship between a ghost and a delinquent!\n\n(Source: Comic Walker, edited)",
   "ja": "街でも悪名高い〈深裏高校〉に転入した梓世那岐は、誰にも使われていない生徒指導室で〈ユーレイさん〉と名乗る幽霊の少年に出会う。\nいくら無視をしても「一緒に遊ぼ」としつこい幽霊に仕方なく「ゲームをして勝ったら幽霊に出て行ってもらう、負けたら幽霊の言うことを一つ聞く」ことになる。\n些細な〈賭けゴト〉だったはずが、梓世の学校生活は大きく変化していく――。\n幽霊と不良のスリリングな友情を描く、学園ファンタジー開幕!!"
  },
